1. Project Overview
This project is an intermediate-level data analysis and visualization task focused on Delhi air-quality data. The notebook loads the dataset with Pandas, prepares the date and pollutant fields, estimates an AQI value using a weighted formula, and visualizes the results through monthly analysis, an AQI distribution plot, weekday box plots, and a pollutant/AQI correlation heatmap.
The submitted README describes the project as an intermediate data-analysis and visualization exercise intended to clean, process, and represent data through meaningful visual insights. It specifically lists Pandas for data handling and Matplotlib for visual reporting, with NumPy noted for numerical operations if used. 
